        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xFelZYVnlaRzQyUzFWQ1ZUbHJTbEpCU0VoUk4wRRAB!2m1!1s0x3403fbd31dc16d3f:0x539370dac633aa86"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJP23BHdP7AzQRhqozxtpwk1M/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKNlpUSkVNMjF5UldoaVVWUmxXRXBaZW1kU1luYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "元朗的Wow Canteen餐廳整體用餐體驗不錯，令人驚訝的是，它允許狗狗直接進入舒適的用餐區！\n\n餐廳位於元朗繁華地段，搭乘大眾運輸工具前往非常方便，但附近停車比較困難。餐廳維持良好的衛生標準，員工服務周到可靠。\n\n招牌蟲草花雞湯味道濃鬱醇厚，略微偏鹹，但整體而言物有所值。需要注意的是，餐廳僅接受現金和八達通卡付款，即使在晚餐高峰時段也無需等待。\n\n餐廳整體佈局寬敞舒適，不會顯得擁擠，非常適合獨自一人或帶著毛茸茸的伙伴一起享受輕鬆的用餐體驗。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Wow Canteen in Yuen Long offers a good overall dining experience, with the pleasant surprise of finding out that dogs are allowed directly inside the comfortable dining space!\nSituated in a vibrant part of Yuen Long, reaching the eatery via local public transit is very convenient, though finding parking nearby remains quite challenging. The restaurant maintains excellent hygiene standards, and the staff delivers normal, reliable service.\nOrdering the signature cordyceps flower chicken soup delivers a wonderfully rich and deep flavor, though it leans slightly on the salty side, while the overall food quality provides solid value for the pricing. Guests should note that payments are strictly limited to cash and Octopus card, and there was no waiting time even during the busy dinner hours.\nFeaturing a general layout that feels comfortably open rather than packed, this welcoming spot is well suited for enjoying a relaxed meal alone or alongside a furry companion.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
